        'video_structure', '{"layer": "video", "claim_type": "design", "for": "the passage-structure chapter of a class video (kmaps-studio build_class: passage_ring, sura_arcs)", "ring": {"colors": {"a": "#F5C451", "b": "#4DD0E1", "c": "#B39DFF", "x": "#FF6FA3"}, "icons": {"A": "type", "B": "book-down", "C": "shield", "X": "heart-handshake", "C′": "scale", "B′": "crown", "A′": "rotate-ccw"}}, "sura": {"relations": ["premise"], "labels": {"self": "The opening: God names Himself", "ring": "The sūra ends where it began", "premise": "The ground for what comes next", "name": "“{en}” comes back later in the sūra", "name_never": "“{en}” is never said again: a gift with nothing owed"}, "icons": {"self": "sparkles", "ring": "repeat", "premise": "brick-wall"}, "colors": {"ring": "#F5C451", "premise": "#4DD0E1"}, "names": [{"ar": "غَافِرِ ٱلذَّنۢبِ", "root": "غفر", "en": "Forgiver", "icon": "eraser", "color": "#69E0A0"}, {"ar": "قَابِلِ ٱلتَّوۡبِ", "root": "توب", "en": "Accepter of return", "icon": "door-open", "color": "#4DD8C0"}, {"ar": "شَدِيدِ ٱلۡعِقَابِ", "root": "عقب", "en": "Severe in penalty", "icon": "gavel", "color": "#FF6B6B"}, {"ar": "ذِي ٱلطَّوۡلِ", "root": "طول", "en": "Possessor of bounty", "icon": "gift", "color": "#B39DFF"}], "names_basis": "meta_function (Structural): each name is repaid later in its own root; the verses are read from qr_word_occurrence at build time"}}', 'video');
